        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Places: Liuzhou, Muling, Mengshan County, Guangxi, Wuzhou City, China\n- Organizations: Guangxi University of Technology\n- Topics: area, population, administrative status\n\nFacts:\n- Liuzhou is a prefecture-level city in north-central Guangxi Zhuang Autonomous Region, People's Republic of China.\n- Liuzhou has a total area of 18,777 km2 and a built-up area of 667 km2.\n- As of 2004, Muling had an area of 6,094 km2 and a population of 330,000.\n- Guangxi University of Technology is a university based in Liuzhou, Guangxi, China.\n- Mengshan County is a county under the administration of Wuzhou City in northeastern Guangxi, China.",
